//! Pinned RailroadDb public feature integrations; exact complete reachable graphs,
//! own descriptors, undefined, UTF-16, IEEE values, ordered Map and shared-array identity.
//! Private byName aliases latest duplicate rules. Typed factory reconstruction cannot
//! recover erased private lookup history after arbitrary typed Vec edits. Nondefault Array length descriptors are
//! explicit; default flags2 is implicit. Constructors, host callbacks/accessors and
//! active lone-surrogate SVG scalar transport remain explicit capability gaps.
